 m.para('**Methods:** Lean and Six Sigma applied in practice, not certified; 5S, PDCA and standard work. **Systems:** MS Office, SAP ERP, Excel, Python and Claude API; Vestas-specific tools and processes require onboarding. **Languages:** professional English and native Danish and Persian.',after=20)
